## Feature 2: 12x36 Batch — Start Day Offset ✅

Currently, 12x36 batch generation always starts with `trabalha = true` on the contract start date. This means all employees in 12x36 work on the same days. 

Adding a **"Dia de Partida"** (`diaPartida`) field allows the manager to toggle the start pattern — even employees start working on day 1, odd employees start resting on day 1.

### Implemented Changes

#### [DONE] [diaria-batch-form.component.ts](file:///home/jpcalsavara/projetos/andamento/InterceptorSystem/frontend/src/app/features/diarias/diaria-batch-form/diaria-batch-form.component.ts)
- ✅ Added `diaPartida` form control: `'TRABALHA'` (default) or `'FOLGA'`
- ✅ Added `selectedFuncionarioEscala` signal to track selected employee's scale type
- ✅ Added `setupFuncionarioChange()` to update scale and reset `diaPartida` on employee change
- ✅ Updated `generateDiariasPreview()`: `let trabalha = formValue.diaPartida !== 'FOLGA'`

